nce of going  and you're worried about your safety  don't really don't be ok anything can  happen anywhere I'm not gonna say  nothing's gonna happen to you but as far  as being in an overtly dangerous place  theft  you know petty crime on the streets is  really low it's one of these countries  that's it's really low and most likely  safer than where you're coming from  ok this path sort of ran out here into  the forest so go go to Saudi Arabia  you'll love it and if you don't love it  love it you'll learn from it and that's  what travel like this is it's like you  can learn about your own country by  being away from it and then you can  learn about a completely different  culture that has things that you admire  so hope that helps have an awesome trip  and yeah check out my series if you want  to see more about Saudi Arabia it's in  the description below okay take care
 

